<title>CHILE: TENNIS-RESULTS OF CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS OF CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results Tuesday from the</p>
<p>Hellmann's Cup ATP tournament (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Alex Lopez Moron (Spain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-4 4-6</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>5-Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Gerald Solves (France) 6-4</p>
<p>3-6 7-5</p>
<p>6-Galo Blanco (Spain) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Luis Adrian Morejon (Ecuador) beat 8-Nicolas Pereira</p>
<p>(Venezuela) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Jacobo Diaz (Spain) beat Lucas Arnold (Argentina) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Franco Squillari (Argentina) beat Pablo Campana (Ecuador) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
